{"text":"大魏永平元年歲在戊子，清州桃泉寺道宋自彼□浮，慶蒙三寶之皈依，鉢餘造彌勒像一區并七佛、二菩薩，衆容俱具。以此微福，普及一切含生，同見彌勒，悟無生□。願願從心。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"桃泉寺","refId":null,"text":"桃泉寺","start":13,"end":16},{"name":"PersonName","term":"道宋","refId":null,"text":"道宋","start":16,"end":18},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"七佛","refId":null,"text":"七佛","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"菩薩","refId":null,"text":"菩薩","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":61,"end":63},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":66,"end":68},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無生法忍","refId":null,"text":"無生","start":70,"end":72}]}